# Subtlety: "choose up to one target creature spell or planeswalker spell. Its owner puts it on their choice of the top or
# bottom of their library." With Cathar Commando (a flash creature spell), Liliana of the Veil (a planeswalker spell) and Lightning
# Bolt (an instant) on Bot2's stack, Bot1 evokes Subtlety by exiling a blue card from its hand (Brainstorm; "Evoke - Exile a
# blue card from your hand" rather than pay its mana cost): the Bolt is refused as a target, the Liliana is chosen, and
# her owner Bot2 declines the top, so she goes to the bottom of the library without being countered. The evoke trigger sacrifices
# Subtlety. The Bolt still resolves (17) and the Commando enters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Subtlety
Brainstorm
Island x5
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Liliana of the Veil
Cathar Commando
Lightning Bolt
